bcxtKWAxWJoK8BHRftDyUQ3IcHCJYBKA4",null,null,["預約制無菜單拉麵"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjG7vbcxtKWAxWJoK8BHRftDyUQ3YcHCJgBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjG7vbcxtKWAxWJoK8BHRftDyUQ3IcHCJcBKA8",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["久違的麵屋山茶，至從大稻埕搬家後就沒再來吃到了。\n這週剛好請假預訂到，就來吃吃看。\n\n現在都採用特定週二官網FB上私訊訂位，不像以前到場用就好了，對我來說不太方便，用餐區比以前大了，是少數預約制拉麵店還有四人併桌位的。\n\n🍜胡麻藤椒擔擔麵 💸$290\n\n先說這次限定的餐點，不是我的最愛...\n擺盤精美，但內容物稍嫌空虛，一直是山茶的特色，之前吃的阿里山茶香拉麵也是如此...\n簡單的三片舒肥雞肉，藤椒末，糖心蛋，甚至連湯都沒裝到8分滿，不加麵的情況真有種吃不飽的懷石料理感，就是如此簡單。\n\n優點自然也有的，這次的藤椒雖然不辣，但是香氣十足！有點像炒過後的椒香肉末，但不油膩。湯頭清爽，且麵是偏硬但很順口，不會像有些店難以吞嚥。\n\n吃完有一種，完成前菜感，滿足，但好像少了什麼。\n啊，原來是少點了小菜！！\n\n有機會再嘗試其他口味了~\n\n🍜麵屋山茶\n地址：新北市板橋區大同街8巷16號\n（板橋江子翠4號出口，步行15分鐘）\n電話：無（詳見FB)\n座位：10~12\n特色：每週限定一款拉麵\n淡麗系拉麵、預約制。\n時間：週一二三公休，其餘營業時間18：00~21：00",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14952979066860684193/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTlNlblZoV25SblJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,3449,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNSenVhWnRnRRAB!2m1!1s